<title>USA: UniComp Inc Q2 shr $0.05 vs $0.11.</title>
<headline>UniComp Inc Q2 shr $0.05 vs $0.11.</headline>
<dateline>MARIETTA, Ga. 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended	  Six Months Ended</p>
<p>		     Aug. 31,   Aug. 31,     Aug. 31,    Aug. 31,</p>
<p>			   1996	1995	   1996	  1995</p>
<p> Total Revenue $5,735,482 $5,146,516  $11,619,517 $10,062,824</p>
