<p>		    5,596,328  5,341,386    5,482,705   5,186,240</p>
<p>NOTES: Comparing six -month results to a year ago, the provision for income taxes increased $170,117 due to full income tax rates this year compared to an 11 percent rate during the same peiod and year earlier, due to the company utilizing its net operating losses in the prior period. -- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
